      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When planning a relocation from Chennai to a distant location, understanding the pricing model employed by packers and movers is crucial. This narrative will provide an overview of how pricing for such a shift is determined, focusing on distance, weight, and service tiers.</p>
