      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">The weight of your belongings is another critical factor in determining the cost. Packers and movers typically charge per kilogram or cubic feet. Multiply the total weight (in kg or cft) by the rate per unit to determine the weight-based cost.</p>
