        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers holds IBA approval and ISO 9001:2015 certification, ensuring that every relocation adheres to industry‑best practices, quality management standards, and regulatory compliance for both household and corporate moves.</p>
